1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,137
A smart thermostat saves about the same wherever you live in America.

2
00:00:04,257 --> 00:00:05,517
What changes is when.

3
00:00:05,637 --> 00:00:09,448
At the ENERGY STAR minimum, a home with gas heat and central air

4
00:00:09,568 --> 00:00:12,810
saves about one hundred eight dollars a year in the Midwest.

5
00:00:12,929 --> 00:00:14,754
One hundred eleven in the South.

6
00:00:14,874 --> 00:00:17,692
Ninety-three in the Northeast, and eighty in the West.

7
00:00:17,812 --> 00:00:21,548
But in the Midwest, seventy-four of those dollars come from heating.

8
00:00:21,668 --> 00:00:24,508
In the South, seventy-one come from air conditioning.

9
00:00:24,628 --> 00:00:27,673
So in a cold state, set it back on winter nights.

10
00:00:27,793 --> 00:00:31,206
In a hot state, set it up on summer afternoons, while you're out.

11
00:00:31,326 --> 00:00:33,027
Same savings, different season.

12
00:00:33,147 --> 00:00:36,664
Because a smart thermostat saves about the same wherever you live.
